[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:74. Out of the Limelight]
[00:00.740] Passage 74 | 文章七十四
[00:03.035] Out of the limelight. | 淡出聚光灯。
[00:06.340] An ancient bus stopped by a dry river bed, and a party of famous actors and actresses got off. | 一辆老式公共汽车停在一条干涸的河床上，一群著名的男演员和女演员下了车。
[00:17.165] Dressed in dark glasses and old clothes, they had taken special precautions so that no one should recognize them. | 他们戴着墨镜，穿着旧衣服，采取了特殊的预防措施，以免被人认出来。
[00:27.700] But as they soon discovered, disguises can sometimes be too perfect. | 但他们很快发现，伪装有时可能太完美了。
[00:35.505] This is a wonderful place for a picnic, | 这里是野餐的好地方，
[00:39.520] said Gloria Gleam. | 格洛丽亚·格利姆说。
[00:41.975] It couldn't be better, Gloria, Brinksley Meers agreed. | “再好不过了，格洛丽亚，”布林克斯利·米尔斯同意道。
[00:46.825] No newspaper men, no film fans. | 没有报社记者，没有影迷。
[00:51.195] Why don't we come more often? | 我们为什么不常来呢？
[00:54.835] Meanwhile, two other actors, Rockwall Slinger and Merlin Greaves, had carried two large food baskets to a shady spot under some trees. | 同时，另外两名演员，洛克沃尔·斯林格和梅林·格里夫斯，提着两个大食物篮，走到树下的一片阴凉处。
[01:08.755] When they had all made themselves comfortable, a stranger appeared. | 当他们都安顿好后，一个陌生人出现了。
[01:14.310] He looked very angry. | 他看起来非常生气。
[01:16.850] Now you get out of here, all of you, he shouted. | “你们现在都给我滚出去，所有人！”他喊道。
[01:21.595] I'm sheriff here. | 我是这里的警长。
[01:23.820] Do you see that notice? | 你们看到那张告示了吗？
[01:26.495] It says no camping, in case you can't read. | 上面写着“禁止露营”，以防你们不识字。
[01:32.985] Look, sheriff, said Rockwall, don't be too hard on us. | “看，警长，”洛克沃尔说，“别对我们太苛刻了。”
[01:38.625] I'm Rockwall Slinger, and this is Merlin Greaves. | 我是洛克沃尔·斯林格，这是梅林·格里夫斯。
[01:43.625] Oh, is it? said the sheriff with a sneer. | “哦，是吗？”警长嗤笑着说。
[01:47.920] Well, I'm Brinksley Meers, and my other name is Gloria Gleam. | “嗯，我是布林克斯利·米尔斯，我的另一个名字是格洛丽亚·格利姆。”
[01:53.610] Now you get out of here fast. | “现在你们立刻给我滚出去。”